  "final_text": "**Disposition:** ESCALATE (proposed, awaiting a human decision). Confidence 0.72.\n\n**Three facts that drove it**\n1. The trader placed a single BUY limit of 38461 on SYN.A, 15.7x average depth and 2 ticks from the touch. It had no fills and was cancelled in full. The trader then sold 1423 at market 2.5 s later. The cancel came 360 ms after that sale.\n2. The bid moved 0.5 tick in the trader's favour and reverted 1.0 tick after the cancel. Cancels were one-sided (cancel_symmetry 0.0).\n3. No legitimate explanation is supported. The trader is a prop trader with no registered market making. There were no market events, no risk events, no parent orders and no fills on the BUY before the sell.\n\n**Why not DRAFT_STOR:** There was only one cycle in the session. The price move was small and the trader has no prior alerts.\n\n**What would change my mind:** Evidence that the 38461 BUY was a genuine client or parent order, or that the SELL closed an earlier long position at a loss. More repeated cycles would push this to DRAFT_STOR.",
